WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.6 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Data protection and privacy

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Collect only the personal data you need, and protect what you keep.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List each dataset: whose, why, where, who sees it.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Decide how long you keep it, then delete.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Give children's and sensitive data extra protection.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: girls' records use a club ID, not surnames; tablets locked; data anonymised after Form 2 tracking.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a data inventory and privacy actions.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
